        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti nibagarra Esanduuko y'Endagaano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esanduuko y'Endagaano ya MUKAMA obuyamazire omunsi y'Abafirisiti ameezi musanju, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu bakeeta baanyakatagara n'abaraguzi baabakaguza bati: “Esanduuko y'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, tugikole ki? Mutugambire omukiikaro kyayo turagigarrayo naki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagarukamu bati: “Obumuraaba nimugigarrayo, mutagigarrayo yonka, baitu mutwekereho MUKAMA ekisembo eky'okubaganyiza ebibi byanyu nubwo mulikira kandi mulikimanya ekyamwikaize nabafubira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakaguza bati: “Ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza omusango ekituraamutwekera, nikiha?” Baagarukamu bati: Ebisisani eby'ebizimba bya zaabbu bitaano, n'embeba za zaabbu itaano, ebirukwinganaingana n'omuhendo ogw'abalemi ab'Abafirisiti; habwokuba kagingo eyabahikireho inywena, niyo yahikireho n'abalemi banyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, kibahikiriire, mukole ebisisani eby'ebizimba byanyu, n'eby'embeba zanyu ezirukusiisa ensi, kandi muhe ekitiinisa Ruhanga owa Isirairi; rundi nubwo araalekera aho kubafubira n'embadwa zanyu, n'ensi yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwaki nimugumanganiza emitima yanyu nk'Abanyamisiri na Faraaho? Ruhanga obuyamazire kubaleetera akabi, abantu batabaikirize kugenda, kandi baagenda kwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nu, muteekanize ekigaali ekihyaka, muleete ente ibiri ezirukukamwa, ezitakahikwahoga kikoligo, mwitwale omuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Esanduuko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, mugite ha kigaali eki, kandi ebintu ebya zaabbu ebimurukumutwekera, biri kihongwa eky'okuganyiza omusango, mubite omu sanduuko endi, nayo mugite haihi neeri, hanyuma mugitweke, ebarugeho egende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugiteho amaiso; obweratoma omuhanda ogurukutwara omunsi yayo yonyini, ogurukugenda Besi-semesi, aho nuho turaamanyira nkooku Ruhanga owa Abaisirairi nuwe yatuleetiire akabi kanu akakooto; baitu obwetaatome omuhanda ogu, turaamanya nkooku atali nuwe ayatuleetiire akabi kanu akatagambwa, buli kakaija konka kaatugwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baakora ekibaabaragiire, baakwata ente ibiri ezirukukamwa, baazibohaho ekigaali, enyana zaazo baazigarra omu ka omunju y'ente. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, baata ha kigaali Esanduuko y'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, baata ha kigaali Esanduuko y'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, hamu n'esanduuko enyakurumu embeba eza zaabbu, n'ebisisani eby'ebizimba byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ente zaagenda itereekeriire, zaakwata omuhanda ogurukutwara Beesi-semesi, ziri omumuhanda gumu ogu, itarukugurugamu, kunu niijuga; itakubuke ha mukono gw'obulyo, rundi ha gw'emoso, abalemi ab'Abafirisiti bakagenda baikuraatiire, okuhikira kimu hamutaano ogwa Beesi-semesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, abantu aba Beesi-semesi bakaba bali omwigesa ly'engano yabo omukihanga; obubaimukize amaiso, baabona Esanduuko ey'Endagaano, baagenda kugitangirra, baijwire omuhimbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigaali obukyahikire ha musiri gwa Yosuha owa Besi-semesi, kyayemerra. Aho nambere kyayemeriire, hakaba haroho ibaale likooto; baayasa ekigaali, ente baaziita, baazokya, baazihongera MUKAMA, zaaba kihongwa eky'okwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi baihaho Esanduuko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, hamu n'Esanduuko endi ey'ekaba egiri ha rubaju, erumu ebintu ebya zaabbu, ebi byona baabita ha ibaale liri erikooto; ha kiro eki, abantu aba Beesi-semesi, bakahonga ebihongwa eby'okwokya, kandi baatambira MUKAMA ebyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakama abataano ab'Abafirisiti obubaaboine ebi, ha kiro eki baagaruka Ekuroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo bizimba ebya zaabbu, Abafirisiti ebi baatwekiire MUKAMA, bibe kihongwa eky'okwihisaaho omusango: Asidodi kimu, Gaaza kimu, Asikeroni kimu, Gaasi kimu, na Ekuroni kimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bakatweka n'embeba eza zaabbu, ezirukwinganaingana omuhendo ogw'embuga eza Abafirisiti; abaalemwaga abalemi abataano, embuga ezombekerwe kurungi zaaguma, n'ebyaro ebitazitiriirwe. Ibaale liri erikooto ery'omumusiri gwa Yosuha owa Beesi-semesi, eribaataireho Esanduuko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, likyaliyo okuhika na hati, nubwo bwakaiso obw'ekintu eki ekyabaireho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akaita abantu aba Beesi-semesi nsanju habwokuba bakalinguza omu Sanduuko y'Endagaano, abantu barra, habwokuba MUKAMA akaita abantu baingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Beesi-semesi nukwo kugamba bati: “Nooha asobora kwemerra omumaiso ga MUKAMA, Ruhanga omuhikiriire onu? Okumwejuna turaamukwatiriza oha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baatumire abakwenda omu bantu aba Kiryasi-yalimu nibagamba bati: “Abafirisiti bagarwire Esanduuko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, mwije mugitabarre mugitwale owanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
